Applies to the files in the skill directories `ponytail`, `ponytail-review`, `ponytail-audit`,
`ponytail-debt`, `ponytail-gain` and `ponytail-help` (SKILL.md each) and to
`.cursor/rules/ponytail.mdc`, vendored from
https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail at commit 09c434ab73ca43761c5d8b0c5d341926c2fba710
(skills/*/SKILL.md and .cursor/rules/ponytail.mdc, MIT-licensed at that commit).
Hooks, status band, Node scripts, plugin manifests, translations and benchmarks are not vendored.

Modified copy: `ponytail/SKILL.md` lacks the `argument-hint` frontmatter key, which the Agent
Skills spec check rejects. Other text is unchanged. The Node hooks, status band and board come
from the upstream plugin (see README), not from these files.

